   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Tiers trade capability for price and speed:\nFable 5.1 > Opus 5.5 > Sonnet 5.5 > Haiku\n5.5. Effort (low \u2026 max) = how hard one model\nthinks. Tokens = billing unit; output costs\n5\u00d7 input.",
   "originalText": "Tiers trade capability for price and speed:\nFable 5.1 > Opus 5.5 > Sonnet 5.5 > Haiku\n5.5. Effort (low \u2026 max) = how hard one model\nthinks. Tokens = billing unit; output costs\n5\u00d7 input.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
