   "text": "JSON schema = the output contract. Structured\noutputs (output_config.format) and strict\ntools (strict: true) make the API return\nschema-valid JSON. Validation-retry = for\nrules a schema can't express, send the error\nback once.",
   "originalText": "JSON schema = the output contract. Structured\noutputs (output_config.format) and strict\ntools (strict: true) make the API return\nschema-valid JSON. Validation-retry = for\nrules a schema can't express, send the error\nback once.",
