   "text": "RAG = retrieve relevant text, then generate\nfrom it. Keyword (BM25) vs embedding (vector)\nvs hybrid search. Reranking = re-order\ncandidates by relevance. Grounding = every\nclaim tied to a source passage.",
   "originalText": "RAG = retrieve relevant text, then generate\nfrom it. Keyword (BM25) vs embedding (vector)\nvs hybrid search. Reranking = re-order\ncandidates by relevance. Grounding = every\nclaim tied to a source passage.",
