   "text": "Gold set = inputs with known right answers.\nCode grader = exact check. LLM-as-judge = a\nmodel grades with a rubric (check it against\nhumans first). Regression gate = CI fails if\nthe score drops.",
   "originalText": "Gold set = inputs with known right answers.\nCode grader = exact check. LLM-as-judge = a\nmodel grades with a rubric (check it against\nhumans first). Regression gate = CI fails if\nthe score drops.",
