   "locked": false,
   "text": "Retry with backoff + jitter on transient\nerrors only. Timeouts everywhere. Validate\nevery output. Let the model answer\n\"uncertain\" and route it. Record failures\nwith the run; never skip silently.",
   "originalText": "Retry with backoff + jitter on transient\nerrors only. Timeouts everywhere. Validate\nevery output. Let the model answer\n\"uncertain\" and route it. Record failures\nwith the run; never skip silently.",
