   "text": "HITL = a person approves or corrects AI\noutput. Confidence routing = low-confidence\nor high-impact items go to review. Feedback\nloop = reviewer verdicts become new labels.",
   "originalText": "HITL = a person approves or corrects AI\noutput. Confidence routing = low-confidence\nor high-impact items go to review. Feedback\nloop = reviewer verdicts become new labels.",
