   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "LLM steps get read-only tools; writes happen\nin code after validation. Mark documents as\ndata. No secrets in prompts. Escape model\ntext before it reaches HTML.",
   "originalText": "LLM steps get read-only tools; writes happen\nin code after validation. Mark documents as\ndata. No secrets in prompts. Escape model\ntext before it reaches HTML.",
