   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "GDPR = EU personal-data law: lawful basis,\nminimisation, retention. EU AI Act =\nrisk-based AI rules with transparency duties.\nBias = error that falls unevenly on a group.\nMethods page = public account of how outputs\nare made.",
   "originalText": "GDPR = EU personal-data law: lawful basis,\nminimisation, retention. EU AI Act =\nrisk-based AI rules with transparency duties.\nBias = error that falls unevenly on a group.\nMethods page = public account of how outputs\nare made.",
   "fontSize": 15,
