   "locked": false,
   "text": "Prompt caching = repeated prefix at ~10% of\ninput price. Batch API = asynchronous, 50%\noff, results within 24 h. Routing = cheap\nmodel first, strong one when needed.\nPre-filter = code removes work before the\nLLM.",
   "originalText": "Prompt caching = repeated prefix at ~10% of\ninput price. Batch API = asynchronous, 50%\noff, results within 24 h. Routing = cheap\nmodel first, strong one when needed.\nPre-filter = code removes work before the\nLLM.",
